<td id="S2.T2.2.1.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_tttt" colspan="4"><span id="S2.T2.2.1.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Phoneme Error Rate </span>(%) <math id="S2.T2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\downarrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">↓</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\downarrow</annotation></semantics></math></td></tr>
